WEBVTT

00:07.620 --> 00:10.650
Fall in love, boys and girls

00:11.290 --> 00:14.320
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

00:14.960 --> 00:17.930
The passion, the way it was born

00:18.530 --> 00:21.300
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

00:22.170 --> 00:25.230
How the hips shake, mucho dizzying

00:25.770 --> 00:28.740
Amigo, that's risky for a kid

00:29.380 --> 00:32.440
If I were to kiss, I'd get sucked in

00:33.010 --> 00:35.380
Tonight, I want to see something scary

00:36.550 --> 00:38.380
Don't be afraid

00:38.380 --> 00:40.190
Going from one push after another

00:40.190 --> 00:42.050
The surprising feeling is nice

00:42.050 --> 00:43.540
And you end up dancing till morning

00:44.020 --> 00:45.560
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.560 --> 00:48.930
TROPICANA

00:50.860 --> 00:54.030
Catch me in the shade under the palm tree

00:54.430 --> 00:57.660
Make me wait, more than down to the limit

00:58.270 --> 01:01.140
I'm sorry, but you're already addicted

01:01.440 --> 01:04.810
From the jungle you can't escape! Haré+Guu!

01:05.480 --> 01:08.410
Fall in love, boys and girls

01:08.750 --> 01:12.080
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

01:12.620 --> 01:15.750
The passion, the way it was born

01:16.290 --> 01:18.280
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

01:31.380 --> 01:32.870
Doctor!

01:33.450 --> 01:35.080
Doctor! Doctor! Doctor!

01:35.490 --> 01:37.950
A letter! A letter! I got a letter!

01:38.060 --> 01:41.020
REST STOP

01:41.460 --> 01:44.150
Doctor, it's a letter! It's a letter from Haré!

01:44.330 --> 01:45.060
You're so cheerful that you're
starting to look like a loon!

01:45.060 --> 01:46.130
Look! Look!
You're so cheerful that you're
starting to look like a loon!

01:46.130 --> 01:46.890
You're so cheerful that you're
starting to look like a loon!

01:47.630 --> 01:47.830
I'll open it right away, so hold on!

01:47.830 --> 01:48.800
You know...
I'll open it right away, so hold on!

01:48.800 --> 01:49.200
I'll open it right away, so hold on!

01:49.300 --> 01:51.770
I want to get a little bit more sleep,
so can you read it in your own room?

01:51.770 --> 01:53.540
A letter from my dear Haré...

01:53.540 --> 01:54.940
...and I've been waiting for it...

01:55.340 --> 01:57.510
It's so wonderful - this feels like
a long-distance relationship!

01:57.510 --> 01:59.910
She still doesn't listen
to what other people say.

01:59.980 --> 02:01.710
All right, I'm going to
read it now, so listen up!

02:01.780 --> 02:02.610
Sure, sure...

02:02.880 --> 02:03.750
Dear Marie,

02:03.750 --> 02:05.450
Hello. How are you doing?

02:05.450 --> 02:07.020
Oh, geez Haré, you're acting so formal!

02:07.020 --> 02:08.050
At least, could you read letters quietly?
Oh, geez Haré, you're acting so formal!

02:08.050 --> 02:09.610
At least, could you read letters quietly?
But you're so cute like that!

02:10.020 --> 02:11.690
I'm doing very well.

02:11.690 --> 02:13.860
I've gotten used to living over here now.

02:13.860 --> 02:17.190
It's quite fun to just explore
through the big mansion.

02:17.430 --> 02:21.430
At first, I wanted to go back
to the jungle every day.

02:21.430 --> 02:23.230
But now, I haven't been
feeling that way as much.

02:23.430 --> 02:26.700
Bell, Ashio, and all the
others are really nice to us.

02:26.770 --> 02:30.540
I enclosed a picture of everyone together,
so please look at it.

02:30.540 --> 02:31.530
Sincerely, Haré.

02:34.280 --> 02:35.610
Don't go getting so used to it!!

02:35.610 --> 02:36.450
What is it?
Don't go getting so used to it!!

02:36.450 --> 02:38.550
Haré... Haré isn't coming back...

02:38.550 --> 02:40.520
I'm sure a woman in the city
slept her way into his life!

02:40.520 --> 02:41.820
Um, do you really understand
the meaning of what you just said?

02:41.820 --> 02:42.720
All of this is because you didn't stop
Weda back then, you fool!
Um, do you really understand
the meaning of what you just said?

02:42.720 --> 02:44.590
All of this is because you didn't stop
Weda back then, you fool!

02:44.590 --> 02:46.820
All of this is because you didn't stop
Weda back then, you fool!
She's a completely different character from
the shock she just got...

02:46.820 --> 02:47.220
All of this is because you didn't stop
Weda back then, you fool!

02:47.220 --> 02:47.560
Oh, well.

02:47.560 --> 02:48.660
Oh, you good-for-nothing!
Oh, well.

02:48.660 --> 02:49.130
Oh, you good-for-nothing!

02:49.130 --> 02:52.260
Oh, you good-for-nothing!
I'm going to be gone for a week or two
myself, so take care.

02:52.260 --> 02:52.660
Oh, you good-for-nothing!

02:53.630 --> 02:55.600
What? Where are you going? Where?

02:55.700 --> 02:57.630
I came to steal your heart away.

02:57.700 --> 02:59.600
That's a lie, doctor... or is that the truth?

02:59.600 --> 03:01.240
I'm sorry to betray your expectations...

03:01.240 --> 03:03.040
...but I'm going to go listen
to lectures at the college.

03:03.170 --> 03:04.370
There was one that caught my attention.

03:04.610 --> 03:08.240
Oh, that's no fun at all.

03:09.050 --> 03:12.280
I'm sure Weda is all lonely because she
doesn't get to see you, Doctor.

03:12.280 --> 03:13.050
I see...

03:13.050 --> 03:14.590
She's being irresponsible again...

03:14.590 --> 03:18.190
I'm sure that at night, she's all lonely and her
heart races when she thinks of you, Doctor!

03:18.190 --> 03:19.060
I see...

03:19.060 --> 03:20.420
That's sounding good...

03:28.270 --> 03:30.930
It's true that I'm going
to go listen to the lectures...

03:31.400 --> 03:33.370
But, doesn't that sound
too much like an excuse?

03:33.600 --> 03:36.000
I'm really hoping that I'll be able to see her...

03:37.570 --> 03:40.240
What am I thinking? I'm nearing 30...

03:44.080 --> 03:46.110
I wonder what she's doing right now...

03:54.120 --> 03:56.090
Oh man, this is boring.

03:57.090 --> 03:59.530
I'm bored of the life here now.

03:59.530 --> 04:02.330
Mom, you were saying that this
was a fun place yesterday.

04:02.630 --> 04:03.730
Did I really say that?

04:03.730 --> 04:06.640
How people feel changes
day by day, you know?

04:06.700 --> 04:09.470
No good... I think I'm going to stop believing
in other people from now on.

04:09.610 --> 04:12.540
In the first place, this place is so uptight.

04:13.380 --> 04:14.500
Oh, allow me.

04:14.850 --> 04:18.210
It's bothersome that someone does
anything and everything for me.

04:18.450 --> 04:20.940
And when I step out, I always have
someone guarding me...

04:21.150 --> 04:23.750
I want to wander around all
by myself once in a while...

04:24.020 --> 04:25.610
Are there any good ideas?

04:26.990 --> 04:29.220
I just came up with a really great idea!

04:29.390 --> 04:31.160
Again? What did you come up with now?

04:31.160 --> 04:33.300
Listen up, Haré. Your mother has an
important errand...

04:33.300 --> 04:35.230
...so don't come into my
room until this evening!

04:35.300 --> 04:36.100
Sure, sure...

04:36.170 --> 04:38.100
Robert and Bell, this applies
to you too. Got it, everyone?

04:38.100 --> 04:39.130
S-Sure...

04:40.300 --> 04:42.070
I wonder what Weda-san is going to do?

04:42.070 --> 04:44.540
Dunno... but I'm sure
it won't be anything too drastic.

04:50.550 --> 04:52.310
I must say that this is a great idea!

04:53.720 --> 04:56.590
All I have to do is sneak out of the window,
and come home before nightfall!

04:56.590 --> 04:57.180
Here goes!

04:58.260 --> 04:59.650
I'm on my way!

05:05.830 --> 05:07.970
Her house is around here.

05:07.970 --> 05:12.200
I kinda found myself walking this way,
but what should I do if I really see her?

05:12.600 --> 05:15.240
Oh, geez! It's not like me to be
all worried about something!

05:15.240 --> 05:16.800
I'm getting irritated at myself!

05:16.870 --> 05:17.740
Because I haven't seen her in a while,
my memories of her are getting rosy.

05:17.740 --> 05:20.180
Doctor.
Because I haven't seen her in a while,
my memories of her are getting rosy.

05:20.780 --> 05:25.410
If I were to think, "That's it?"
When I see her again, maybe it's better if I
didn't see her at all...

05:25.520 --> 05:27.420
I'll leave it as a beautiful memory...

05:28.620 --> 05:30.310
There's no certainty that
I'll even see her in the first place.

05:30.520 --> 05:32.550
I guess I'll head over to
a friend's place now instead.

05:48.210 --> 05:49.170
Doctor?

05:51.640 --> 05:54.300
Wow, what are you doing here?
Did you return here too, Doctor?

05:54.510 --> 05:56.950
Oh, yeah, I did. I just got back today.

05:57.150 --> 05:59.550
Wow! My fantasy wasn't anything
comparable to this!

05:59.550 --> 06:01.350
It's wonderful that I can
see you so suddenly like this!
In the small while that I haven't seen her...

06:01.350 --> 06:03.290
Don't you think God does such nifty things?
In the small while that I haven't seen her...

06:03.290 --> 06:05.120
Come to think of it, I haven't seen you in
quite a while.
I had forgotten her smile, how she talks
- and so many other things.

06:05.120 --> 06:06.180
How've you been?
I had forgotten her smile, how she talks
- and so many other things.

06:06.960 --> 06:09.360
You're as wonderful as
you always were Weda-chan.

06:09.530 --> 06:11.130
Stop joking, Doctor.

06:11.130 --> 06:13.260
And she still has no faith in me.

06:13.930 --> 06:15.300
Just like always!

06:16.830 --> 06:18.000
Hey, it's Guu.

06:18.000 --> 06:19.230
Hey, hey, Guu, what are you doing?

06:19.540 --> 06:20.600
Oh, it's Weda-sama.

06:20.600 --> 06:21.940
Oh, it's Mom?

06:23.370 --> 06:25.640
W-W-W-What's the school doc doing here!?

06:25.640 --> 06:26.540
I didn't hear about this!

06:28.010 --> 06:28.880
You know him?

06:28.880 --> 06:31.510
He's the worst gigolo out there! He followed
Mom all the way from the jungle!

06:32.150 --> 06:35.280
The strong, valiant
Weda-sama prefers men like that?

06:35.750 --> 06:38.240
Since we bumped into each other,
would you like to hang out with me a bit?

06:38.460 --> 06:39.290
I won't let her go!

06:40.190 --> 06:41.730
Don't be a fool.

06:41.730 --> 06:42.750
Y-You're so masculine...

06:42.930 --> 06:46.960
He came all the way out to the city to see
Weda. That means he truly cares for her.

06:46.960 --> 06:49.470
He probably doesn't have an ulterior motive.

06:49.470 --> 06:52.300
How about we watch
over them warmly for now?

06:52.870 --> 06:54.670
I see, we stalk them?

06:54.670 --> 06:55.570
Exactly!

06:55.770 --> 06:58.170
Wow! Talk about being a real fool.

06:58.340 --> 07:01.680
But, it's true that he came
all the way out here to the city...

07:01.950 --> 07:04.780
That dishonest, macho-posing guy who
hates getting into a mess...

07:05.350 --> 07:07.650
Does that mean he's
really serious about this?

07:08.220 --> 07:09.820
Then, where shall we go?

07:09.820 --> 07:10.880
Do you want to go anywhere?

07:12.420 --> 07:13.480
Anywhere is fine.

07:13.660 --> 07:16.420
A-anywhere!?

07:17.530 --> 07:19.360
Y-You really don't care where?

07:19.600 --> 07:20.330
Yeah.

07:20.330 --> 07:22.760
The city changed so much that
I don't know the area well anymore.

07:22.900 --> 07:26.540
T-Then, let's go somewhere quiet!

07:26.540 --> 07:27.530
S-sure...

07:27.740 --> 07:29.010
All right, let's start tailing.

07:29.010 --> 07:29.570
Got it!

07:29.570 --> 07:31.440
That guy's ulterior motives
are damn obvious!

07:31.710 --> 07:33.870
This is a love story between adults.

07:34.340 --> 07:37.440
A man and a woman happen to reunite
unexpectedly in the city...

07:37.920 --> 07:42.250
Where are the two headed,
now that a premonition of a passionate
romance shakes their hearts?

07:42.990 --> 07:45.320
This is just like the story
between Weda and the school doc.

07:45.320 --> 07:46.490
Not at all!

07:46.490 --> 07:48.860
By the way, it's rated "R"
so kids can't go see it.

07:48.860 --> 07:50.990
Like we could show something like that!?
We'd get complaints from all over the place!

07:50.990 --> 07:52.360
Right now, my mom is in danger!

07:52.360 --> 07:54.430
I have to protect Mom from
the evil hands of the school doc!

07:54.430 --> 07:54.950
End of story!

07:55.400 --> 07:58.270
Geez, if we waste time in a weird position
like this, we'll lose sight of them!

07:58.270 --> 07:59.460
Oh, they're coming!

08:02.440 --> 08:04.210
Oh, geez, they're so close together!

08:04.210 --> 08:05.310
They look like they're getting along so well!

08:05.310 --> 08:08.450
Haré-sama, you're acting like a husband
who's witnessing his wife having an affair.

08:08.450 --> 08:11.850
And, according to him, that professor
won't be seriously...

08:16.020 --> 08:17.050
What was that?

08:17.050 --> 08:17.880
A gunshot?

08:21.530 --> 08:24.130
YOU!

08:24.130 --> 08:26.900
You really are a dangerous
guy at heart, aren't you!?

08:26.900 --> 08:28.870
Well, if you thought he was in the way that
much, I thought it would be better to...

08:28.870 --> 08:31.130
All we have to do is to follow them
so that they don't see us!

08:31.130 --> 08:32.930
That makes us nothing but peeping-toms!

08:33.100 --> 08:36.440
How about we move in if the
target does anything strange.

08:36.440 --> 08:37.340
Hey, that's a great idea!

08:37.340 --> 08:39.110
It's like a cop show or something!

08:39.110 --> 08:41.240
Then, let's hurry up and
make nicknames for ourselves?

08:41.240 --> 08:42.710
How about "Jean Pants"?

08:42.710 --> 08:44.850
Or "Short Pants", "Swim pants",
"No Pants"...

08:44.850 --> 08:45.080
You know... Are you guys
enjoying my mom being in a crisis?

08:45.080 --> 08:46.050
I wonder what's good?
You know... Are you guys
enjoying my mom being in a crisis?

08:46.050 --> 08:47.250
Of course, it'd be "No Pants."
You know... Are you guys
enjoying my mom being in a crisis?

08:47.250 --> 08:48.910
But, wouldn't that be a bad thing visually?
You know... Are you guys
enjoying my mom being in a crisis?

08:49.950 --> 08:51.180
Welcome!

08:52.090 --> 08:53.220
They entered a café.

08:53.320 --> 08:55.560
All right, let's get as close as
possible and see what they... -

08:55.560 --> 08:56.930
Wait, they'll see us for sure that way...

08:56.930 --> 08:58.220
I have a good idea.

09:09.970 --> 09:10.910
Welcome!

09:10.910 --> 09:12.640
Are you ready to order?

09:13.080 --> 09:13.910
Café Americano.

09:14.040 --> 09:14.670
Water.

09:15.780 --> 09:17.970
O-Orange juice...

09:18.080 --> 09:19.980
Haré-sama, more enthusiasm!

09:19.980 --> 09:22.510
I would like an orange juice, please!

09:22.850 --> 09:23.850
Actually...

09:23.850 --> 09:25.980
Why am I the only one
wearing girl's clothes?

09:26.120 --> 09:29.130
You can't help but disguise yourself when
following someone who knows your face.

09:29.130 --> 09:30.820
Especially you, Haré-sama.

09:30.930 --> 09:32.100
Don't complain!

09:32.100 --> 09:33.260
I'm a pet.

09:33.260 --> 09:34.890
Yours is a costume!!

09:36.000 --> 09:36.930
Something wrong?

09:36.930 --> 09:40.300
No, I thought I heard an
awfully familiar voice just now...

09:40.940 --> 09:42.130
...but I think it was just me.

09:42.970 --> 09:45.910
Then, Doctor, you came all the way out here
to listen to a lecture at the university?

09:45.910 --> 09:46.880
You really study hard!

09:46.980 --> 09:48.910
That's not really true. It's normal.

09:48.910 --> 09:51.380
Besides, I wanted to see you too, Weda-chan.

09:51.780 --> 09:52.910
Is he finally trying to seduce her?

09:53.980 --> 09:54.920
Oh, I see.

09:57.750 --> 09:58.960
Miss, can I have a refill?
You know, Haré-sama...

09:58.960 --> 09:59.360
Miss, can I have a refill?
Perhaps there's no need for
us to worry about Weda-sama.

09:59.360 --> 09:59.690
Perhaps there's no need for
us to worry about Weda-sama.

09:59.690 --> 10:00.360
Right away!
Perhaps there's no need for
us to worry about Weda-sama.

10:00.360 --> 10:03.190
Perhaps there's no need for
us to worry about Weda-sama.

10:03.460 --> 10:05.160
I forgot about one thing...

10:05.300 --> 10:06.260
Mom is...

10:06.360 --> 10:07.730
...very dense.

10:07.930 --> 10:09.990
The cocoa here is very tasty.

10:10.270 --> 10:13.860
I'm troubled that she would
so nonchalantly ignore that line...

10:14.910 --> 10:18.170
Am I mistaken to expect a
normal woman's reaction from her?

10:18.580 --> 10:18.880
But, I'm tired of this vague relationship!

10:18.880 --> 10:20.210
Here you go!
But, I'm tired of this vague relationship!

10:20.210 --> 10:20.940
But, I'm tired of this vague relationship!

10:20.940 --> 10:23.280
Right! I'm going to settle this right now!

10:24.110 --> 10:26.280
Hey, I'm sorry to ask all of a sudden...

10:26.280 --> 10:28.180
...but do you have a boyfriend right now?

10:28.320 --> 10:31.050
Oh brother, does it look like I do?
Are you insulting me?

10:31.050 --> 10:32.390
No, no, not at all...

10:32.390 --> 10:35.220
At the least, she's not
seeing any guy right now...

10:35.390 --> 10:37.550
Doctor, isn't it you that have
someone you want to see over here?

10:39.200 --> 10:40.660
You have at least five or six, don't you?

10:41.200 --> 10:44.360
Does it seem like I chase after that many
women or something?

10:44.970 --> 10:49.930
I'm sorry, but I only have
my eyes on one woman...

10:50.510 --> 10:52.410
You can't tell who it is?

11:00.620 --> 11:02.150
This is like some drama series!

11:02.150 --> 11:03.920
It's amazing, Haré-sama!

11:05.160 --> 11:08.730
I won't allow it! Not dating a man like him!

11:08.730 --> 11:10.630
Haré-sama, you're terribly, terribly scary.

11:11.130 --> 11:12.720
I have no choice. I guess I'll shut him up.

11:12.800 --> 11:13.730
No, wait a moment.

11:14.430 --> 11:15.730
What are you planning on doing?

11:17.500 --> 11:18.400
I was being careless.

11:18.400 --> 11:20.840
Don't you think about settling
things in a peaceful manner!?

11:20.900 --> 11:21.440
Now, now...

11:21.440 --> 11:22.110
Huh?

11:22.110 --> 11:25.410
If you say this is bad and that's bad, you
won't become a better person, "No Pants".

11:25.410 --> 11:26.480
Who's "No Pants"!?

11:26.480 --> 11:29.540
How about you let Robert
have his way for once?

11:29.850 --> 11:31.680
If I did, we'd end up watching a catastrophe!

11:31.680 --> 11:35.420
Don't be irresponsible!
If you're going that far, then
why don't you do something about it?

11:35.420 --> 11:36.680
Eh, Guu-san?

11:38.420 --> 11:40.620
All I need to do is to interrupt the
conversation, right?

11:40.690 --> 11:42.260
Yeah, that's right.

11:42.260 --> 11:43.120
Well, just watch.

11:43.190 --> 11:44.130
A-A blowgun!?

11:45.860 --> 11:47.190
And the bullet is a pokute!?

11:54.070 --> 11:55.770
I-I-I'm terribly sorry, sir!

11:55.770 --> 11:56.640
Nice, Guu! That was a success!
L-l-I'm terribly sorry, sir!

11:56.640 --> 11:57.470
Nice, Guu! That was a success!
I'll bring a towel right away!

11:57.470 --> 11:58.410
That was a success?
I'll bring a towel right away!

11:59.010 --> 12:00.810
Somehow, I don't feel comfortable here.

12:00.810 --> 12:01.870
You want to go somewhere else?

12:02.580 --> 12:05.670
If you wander around outside
like that, you'll catch a cold.

12:06.020 --> 12:08.450
A success! Go home! Go home!
But I want to spend a little
more time with you, Weda-chan.

12:08.550 --> 12:11.150
A success! Go home! Go home!
But, Doctor, you need to do
something about that outfit first.

12:11.150 --> 12:14.660
A success! Go home! Go home!
Then, I'll go grab a change of clothes,
so come back to the hotel with me.

12:14.660 --> 12:16.650
A success! Go home! Go home!
Sure. How about you take
a shower while you're at it?

12:18.430 --> 12:20.100
Tagging along to a hotel.

12:20.100 --> 12:22.600
Alone. A world just for adults, huh...

12:22.600 --> 12:24.570
It's an easy equation to understand.

12:24.670 --> 12:26.840
Big success!

12:26.840 --> 12:28.070
Big trouble.

12:36.810 --> 12:39.720
Oh, what should we do!? At this rate,
I won't be able to recover from everything!

12:39.720 --> 12:41.620
Mom will be scarred!

12:41.620 --> 12:44.550
Haré-sama, as always,
you don't think like a normal child.

12:44.750 --> 12:45.780
Don't you have to follow them?

12:54.030 --> 12:56.060
E-Excuse me! Just a minute!

12:58.400 --> 12:59.440
The seventh floor...

12:59.440 --> 13:01.600
Then we get off one floor early
and dash up the stairs.

13:05.740 --> 13:08.210
Ah, that was close! They didn't notice us...

13:08.810 --> 13:09.870
Actually...

13:10.050 --> 13:12.340
Why didn't they notice? Guu...

13:20.690 --> 13:22.430
Haré-sama, one floor up!

13:22.430 --> 13:23.220
Y-Yeah!

13:24.930 --> 13:25.860
That room!

13:27.000 --> 13:28.400
Let's see what they're doing inside!

13:28.400 --> 13:29.100
S-Sure!

13:29.100 --> 13:31.000
Weda, want me to make some tea?

13:31.130 --> 13:32.030
Sure.

13:32.340 --> 13:34.340
Why are they all relaxed and stuff!

13:34.340 --> 13:37.070
If someone were to see us,
they'd get a bad impression...

13:41.010 --> 13:42.710
Room 704, no problems!

13:42.710 --> 13:43.580
No problems!

13:46.020 --> 13:46.750
Weirdo!

13:46.750 --> 13:48.450
I don't want to hear it from
you when you're dressed like that!

13:48.950 --> 13:50.440
Now, what should we do?

13:51.990 --> 13:53.580
This is a pretty nice room.

13:55.630 --> 13:58.190
Guest, I have brought your room service.

13:59.160 --> 14:02.630
Room service?
I don't recall ordering anything...

14:02.630 --> 14:08.200
Today is a special service day, and we are
delivering tea and sweets to all guests.

14:08.310 --> 14:09.700
Oh, is that so?

14:09.840 --> 14:12.310
Haré-sama, Haré-sama,
this is Robert, do you copy?

14:12.680 --> 14:13.980
You're fine with the plan, right?

14:13.980 --> 14:16.780
When I'm done with this,
I'll be waiting outside the room.

14:16.780 --> 14:18.850
If something happens, contact me.

14:18.850 --> 14:19.870
I'll be right over.

14:19.950 --> 14:21.320
This is Haré, this is Haré.

14:21.320 --> 14:22.320
Roger that, Robert.

14:22.320 --> 14:24.050
If something happens to Mom,
I'm counting on you!

14:24.050 --> 14:26.020
Boy, this is getting exciting, "No Pants".

14:26.020 --> 14:28.220
I already told you, who's this "No Pants"!?
We're not playing around here!

14:28.460 --> 14:30.360
Sorry to keep you waiting, sir.

14:30.360 --> 14:32.920
All preparations are ready,
so please have some.

14:33.000 --> 14:36.300
Yeah, we were planning on having some tea.

14:36.300 --> 14:37.630
Good timing. Thanks.

14:37.700 --> 14:39.570
I see, then I will...

14:42.340 --> 14:43.500
W-What was that?

14:43.570 --> 14:45.340
I just heard some massive noise...

14:45.910 --> 14:47.540
Rejoice. The crisis is over.

14:47.610 --> 14:49.010
That was the worst thing to do, idiot!!

14:49.110 --> 14:52.080
Is something hidden under this cart?

14:52.550 --> 14:56.420
Oh, come to think of it... I'm sorry sir,
this was for the guests next door.

14:56.420 --> 14:57.150
Now, excuse me...

14:59.120 --> 15:00.650
What in the world was that?

15:00.990 --> 15:01.960
Dunno...

15:02.530 --> 15:04.490
What the heck are you trying to do!?

15:04.560 --> 15:05.930
Thrill and suspense!

15:06.100 --> 15:07.460
What's up with that!?

15:07.460 --> 15:09.470
Now, what to do next...

15:09.470 --> 15:11.500
Somehow, we ended up in a confusion.

15:11.500 --> 15:12.630
Want me to make a new pot of tea?

15:12.740 --> 15:15.100
Oh, but Doctor, you need
to take a shower first.

15:15.310 --> 15:17.140
Think so? Then, can you wait here?

15:17.140 --> 15:18.270
Sure thing!

15:39.430 --> 15:42.360
The doctor sleeps on this bed...

15:51.740 --> 15:54.900
We don't know what to expect,
so please be careful!

15:55.010 --> 15:56.210
Yeah, got it!

15:56.310 --> 15:58.520
Guu-san, if anything happens, I'm relying
on you to help Haré-sama!

15:58.520 --> 15:59.570
Leave it to me!

15:59.650 --> 16:01.120
I'll try to do it alone as much as possible...

16:02.520 --> 16:05.080
I don't want to get into another
situation like the one earlier...

16:05.290 --> 16:06.950
Don't get in my way this time, Guu.

16:07.220 --> 16:09.260
No, that's a misunderstanding, "No Pants".

16:09.260 --> 16:11.930
Guu always does everything
for your sake, "No Pants".

16:11.930 --> 16:13.590
I've been saying, who the heck
is "No Pants"!?

16:18.700 --> 16:19.600
What's wrong, Guu?

16:19.600 --> 16:20.600
I'm stuck.

16:20.600 --> 16:21.540
I see...

16:23.240 --> 16:24.600
A rat?

16:32.180 --> 16:34.050
G-G-G-GUU! Move aside!!

16:34.050 --> 16:34.880
Can't.

16:34.950 --> 16:35.820
What are we going to do about that!?

16:35.820 --> 16:36.620
Just deal with it.
What are we going to do about that!?

16:36.620 --> 16:37.090
Just deal with it.

16:37.090 --> 16:38.820
My life will end before that!

16:47.130 --> 16:48.190
Oh, Haré-sama!

16:49.470 --> 16:50.730
What happened, Haré-sama!?

16:51.070 --> 16:52.730
It's wonderful to be alive...

16:55.570 --> 16:56.560
Huh?

17:05.950 --> 17:10.280
I'm fully aware that she doesn't
feel that way at all, but...

17:10.920 --> 17:12.260
Weda-chan!

17:12.260 --> 17:13.920
Oh no, Doctor!

17:14.160 --> 17:17.520
...I can't help running
simulations in my mind!

17:19.100 --> 17:19.860
Yes?

17:19.860 --> 17:23.090
I'm sorry, I'm with the police - will you help
me with an investigation?

17:23.500 --> 17:25.500
A dangerous deal is taking
place in the next room over.

17:25.500 --> 17:26.670
I would like to look inside their room.

17:26.670 --> 17:27.340
It will be over in an instant!

17:27.340 --> 17:28.170
S-Sure...

17:28.710 --> 17:29.870
Now, Haré-sama, hurry!

17:30.770 --> 17:32.930
It's all right, in here,
we won't look suspicious.

17:33.680 --> 17:36.010
Who are these suspicious-looking people?

17:36.010 --> 17:37.740
And this kid, a while ago...

17:38.180 --> 17:40.120
I can hear a shower.

17:40.180 --> 17:41.670
Does that mean someone's naked!?

17:47.060 --> 17:49.760
That's strange... I was sure that
they were doing the deal here...

17:49.760 --> 17:51.390
That's right... you know...

17:55.130 --> 17:56.470
Hello, is this the police?

17:56.470 --> 17:57.360
Sorry to have bothered you!

17:57.830 --> 18:02.330
But still, she did come to the hotel...
Maybe she's dropping a hint.

18:03.310 --> 18:06.240
Of all people, she wouldn't even think of it.

18:06.710 --> 18:07.440
I should just change into clothes.

18:07.840 --> 18:09.910
Hey, Robert, aren't you done yet? Hurry up!

18:09.910 --> 18:11.140
Y-Yes, right away!

18:11.480 --> 18:12.740
Let's see...

18:12.920 --> 18:13.810
Is it this one?

18:14.680 --> 18:15.450
Wait...

18:15.720 --> 18:17.950
Fast! Too Fast! It's too fast!

18:23.590 --> 18:24.960
T-T-T-Thanks, Guu.

18:25.060 --> 18:26.360
Y-Y-You saved me!

18:26.700 --> 18:28.430
Would you like to become one of the stars in
the heavens, "No Pants"?

18:28.430 --> 18:29.830
NOOOOOOO!!

18:29.900 --> 18:31.260
This is dangerous! Let's go back up.

18:33.570 --> 18:35.060
Wait, Mom is on the bed?!

18:36.170 --> 18:37.730
Too fast!!

18:39.840 --> 18:42.780
Oh no, I must have fallen asleep...

18:43.250 --> 18:44.610
I'm sorry, Doctor.

18:44.610 --> 18:45.740
Oh, you're up?

18:45.920 --> 18:48.150
It's okay, it hasn't been even 15 minutes.

18:51.620 --> 18:54.220
You were like this in the jungle too, Doctor...

18:54.220 --> 18:56.990
When I'm asleep, you always wait
and never wake me up.

18:57.630 --> 18:58.650
Really?

18:58.830 --> 18:59.450
Yeah...

18:59.800 --> 19:00.690
I like that.

19:01.900 --> 19:04.330
I like that about you, doctor...

19:10.370 --> 19:11.310
...Sorry.

19:11.910 --> 19:12.930
Weda-chan, I...

19:15.180 --> 19:15.970
Sorry.

19:16.780 --> 19:17.770
I forgive you.

19:21.680 --> 19:23.950
What did she forgive me for?

19:28.190 --> 19:30.090
Oh, well...

19:32.900 --> 19:34.830
Oh, what should we do about this!?

19:34.830 --> 19:36.560
We'll just have to break in!

19:53.380 --> 19:55.110
Oh no! It's this late already!?
I have to get back!

19:55.650 --> 19:57.390
What? What's the matter now?

19:57.390 --> 20:00.620
I have to be home by dinnertime, or they'll
realize that I snuck out of the house!

20:00.620 --> 20:02.590
It's all right if you're a little late...

20:02.590 --> 20:05.120
Nope. Bell is really scary when she gets mad.

20:05.660 --> 20:06.690
Oh no...

20:07.060 --> 20:10.300
It's not like I can stay here for that long...

20:10.300 --> 20:11.330
Well, Doctor...

20:11.330 --> 20:12.900
Another goodbye, huh...

20:12.900 --> 20:13.700
I'll see you later!

20:17.610 --> 20:18.470
Weda-chan...

20:19.280 --> 20:20.260
I'll see you later!

20:22.050 --> 20:23.310
That means...

20:26.150 --> 20:27.520
I'll go in first.

20:27.520 --> 20:29.290
I'll leave Weda-san to you.

20:29.290 --> 20:30.580
We're counting on you, "No Pants".

20:30.720 --> 20:31.310
Okay!

20:33.220 --> 20:34.050
Fire!

20:40.960 --> 20:42.070
W-What's with you guys?

20:42.070 --> 20:42.900
Quiet!

20:43.000 --> 20:44.400
Now, Haré-sama, quickly!

20:45.030 --> 20:46.870
Mom? Mom!! Mom?!

20:46.870 --> 20:48.100
Y-You know...
Mom? Mom!! Mom?!

20:48.200 --> 20:49.430
Shut up!

20:50.040 --> 20:51.630
Strange... Mom's not here.

20:51.740 --> 20:54.270
Is that so? Then maybe she went home?

21:08.060 --> 21:10.960
Ojou-sama, what were you
doing in your room today?

21:11.230 --> 21:12.490
Oh, nothing!

21:12.600 --> 21:13.690
But...

21:13.830 --> 21:16.530
Haré and Robert, how'd
you get hurt like that?

21:16.530 --> 21:17.630
Oh, it's nothing.

21:17.630 --> 21:19.360
Boy, he sure was tough...

21:19.700 --> 21:21.400
Today's lesson...

21:23.470 --> 21:24.670
...No Pants!

22:31.100 --> 22:32.340
NEXT EPISODE

22:36.340 --> 22:39.340
I'm bored. It's nice to take it easy, but actually there's nothing to do.

22:39.340 --> 22:40.910
Why did Mom come back here?

22:40.910 --> 22:44.480
Bell said something about a grandma being here, but there's no signs of such a
person coming to visit

22:44.480 --> 22:46.820
What, Guu? Then we should play tag?

22:46.820 --> 22:49.050
That's fine, but tag is a
really innocent game for you to mention.

22:49.050 --> 22:49.920
Oh, so you're it, Guu?

22:49.920 --> 22:51.220
All right, I'm on the run!

22:51.220 --> 22:52.350
Wait, Guu is it?

22:52.350 --> 22:53.890
Oh no, I have to be serious
about getting away!

22:53.890 --> 22:54.620
Wait, this is...

22:54.620 --> 22:55.260
A forest?

22:55.260 --> 22:56.460
Oh no, I've gotten lost!

22:56.460 --> 22:57.320
Wait... a forest?

22:57.730 --> 22:59.230
Next episode of Haré+Guu:
Terror! Humane Game of Tag

22:59.230 --> 23:01.600
Next episode of Haré+Guu: Terror! Humane Game of Tag

23:01.600 --> 23:03.830
This person... Could it be?
